# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation and project meta — kept local, never pushed.
#
# The repository carries only what runs the app and what maintains it. The
# decision record, the spec and the agent instructions live on disk here and
# are NOT versioned. They have no backup: copy them somewhere else if they
# matter to you.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
/docs/
/SPEC.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/.claude/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client material — never commit. A budget document tracked in the first
# commit of the previous repository is the reason this repository exists.
# These patterns fail closed: anything matching stays out even if staged by
# accident with `git add .`.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.docx
/*.doc
/*.pdf
/*.xlsx
/*.csv
Biodiversidade Darwincore*

